  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To allow Mementos to display paths to the canonical version of children even if those resources are deleted we would like to create a new internal-prefix for those paths and necessary transformers to convert that prefix to a full URI without dereferencing the JCR Node (as it might be deleted).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This task is to create that internal prefix and create a transformer to convert a node at ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "some-prefix:/rest/foo/bar",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "to",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "http:// <some host and port> / <context path if applicable> /rest/foo/bar",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "for example",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
