  "description": "<p>To allow Mementos to display paths to the canonical version of children even if those resources are deleted we would like to create a new internal-prefix for those paths and necessary transformers to convert that prefix to a full URI without dereferencing the JCR Node (as it might be deleted).</p>\n\n<p>This task is to create that internal prefix and create a transformer to convert a node at <br/>\nsome-prefix:/rest/foo/bar<br/>\nto<br/>\nhttp:// &lt;some host and port&gt; / &lt;context path if applicable&gt; /rest/foo/bar<br/>\nfor example</p>",
